# NoteFlow Environment Configuration Template
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IMPORTANT (Rubric III Coding Guideline):
# Never commit real API keys, service-account credentials, or secrets to Git,
# and never hard-code LLM API keys inside Dart client code.
#
# 1. Server / Serverless AI Proxy Configuration (Backend only):
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash
AI_PROXY_PORT=8787

# 2. Flutter Client Build/Run Defines (Safe public endpoints only):
# Pass via: flutter run --dart-define=AI_PROXY_URL=http://localhost:8787/api/ai
AI_PROXY_URL=
